        m_Value: '{0:plural:The floor|All {} floors} at height {1}: change {0:plural:it|them} to {2}, or add {2} as a new floor height?'
    - rid: 552786204080472245
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1601825292290
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0:plural:The ceiling|All {} ceilings} at height {1}: change {0:plural:it|them} to {2}, or add {2} as a new ceiling height?'
    - rid: 552786204080472246
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1601825292291
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0:plural:One floor|{} floors} at height {1} would be above {0:plural:its ceiling|their ceilings} at {2}, so they can''t all be changed. Add {2} as a new floor height?'
    - rid: 552786204080472247
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1601825292292
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0:plural:One ceiling|{} ceilings} at height {1} would be below {0:plural:its floor|their floors} at {2}, so they can''t all be changed. Add {2} as a new ceiling height?'
    - rid: 552786240694648898
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 188820485718016
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The height, in 1024ths of a world unit. Type it as whole world units and 1024ths (such as "2 and 512/1024"), as 1024ths alone (such as "2560/1024" or "2560"), as a decimal number of world units (such as "2.5"), as a percentage of a world unit (such as "250%"), or as another fraction (such as "5/2"). Type a new height to change it.
